WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Juri’s Drive Impact reaches Ryu’s corner guard.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:01.900
The blocked Impact crushes Ryu into the wall.

3
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.400
Crouching heavy punch begins the wall-crush conversion.

4
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.400
Medium Fuhajin juggles and builds a Fuha stock.

5
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.700
Heavy Tensenrin finishes the corner juggle.
